  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Chop cauliflower (including the stalk!) into small florets. Cut sweet potato into large chunks. <br>• Place veggies on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle with BBQ spice blend, drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. <br>• Roast until tender and brown around the edges, 20-25 mins. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e1125bd0c12080033da1/step-43fb9b00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat. <br>• Cook Tex-Mex spice blend (use less if you’re sensitive to heat) and garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. <br>• Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. <br>• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water absorbed, 10 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e1125bd0c12080033da1/step-46e09910.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn. <br>• Heat frying pan over high heat. Add corn and cook until lightly browned, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a medium bowl. <br>• Roughly chop tomato, then transfer to bowl with charred corn. <br>• Drizzle with olive oil and white wine vinegar. Toss to coat and season to taste with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e1125bd0c12080033da1/step-71eb6720.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide spiced rice and roast cauliflower between bowls. <br>• Top with charred corn salsa and sour cream to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e1125bd0c12080033da1/step-a2f1b830.jpg"
    }
  ]
